feat: permanent customers schema + returning customer greeting

Schema: add PermanentCustomer model (companyId, fullName, phone,
tripDate, hotelName, packageLevel, gender, birthDate, age, jobTitle,
address, governorate, tripsCount, source, notes).
source values: "legacy" | "pipeline" | "manual"

AI greeting: before getAgentReply, query PermanentCustomer by
phone+companyId where source != "legacy". If found, pass
returningCustomer={name, tripsCount} through getAgentReply ->
buildSystemPrompt -> buildBasePersonality which prepends a special
welcome-back block to the system prompt for returning customers.

